  "q-113923": {
    "level": "moderate",
    "parameters": {
      "a": 3,
      "b": 2
    },
    "prompt": "$\\int ({a}\\operatorname{cos}x-{b}\\operatorname{sec}x\\,\\operatorname{tan}x)\\,\\text{d}x=$",
    "source_id": "q-113923",
    "variable": "x",
    "fields": [],
    "difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
    "solution": "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\operatorname{cos}x\\,\\text{d}x & =\\operatorname{sin}x+C, \\\\ \\int \\operatorname{sec}x\\operatorname{tan}x\\,\\text{d}x & =\\operatorname{sec}x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ({a}\\operatorname{cos}x-{b}\\operatorname{sec}x\\,\\operatorname{tan}x)\\,\\text{d}x & ={a}\\int \\operatorname{cos}x\\,\\text{d}x-{b}\\int \\operatorname{sec}x\\operatorname{tan}x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={a}\\operatorname{sin}x-{b}\\operatorname{sec}x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$"
  },
  "q-113925": {
    "level": "moderate",
    "parameters": {
      "a": 2
    },
    "prompt": "$\\int ({a}\\operatorname{csc}x\\,\\operatorname{cot}x+\\operatorname{sin}x)\\,\\text{d}x=$",
    "source_id": "q-113925",
    "variable": "x",
    "fields": [],
    "difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
    "solution": "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\operatorname{sin}x\\,\\text{d}x & =-\\operatorname{cos}x+C, \\\\ \\int \\operatorname{csc}x\\operatorname{cot}x\\,\\text{d}x & =-\\operatorname{csc}x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ({a}\\operatorname{csc}x\\,\\operatorname{cot}x+\\operatorname{sin}x)\\,\\text{d}x & ={a}\\int \\operatorname{cos}\\operatorname{csc}x\\,\\operatorname{cot}x\\,\\text{d}x+\\int \\operatorname{sin}x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={a}(-\\operatorname{csc}x)+(-\\operatorname{cos}x)+C \\\\  & =-{a}\\operatorname{csc}x-\\operatorname{cos}x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$"
  },
  "q-71657": {
    "level": "easy",
    "parameters": {
      "a": 8
    },
    "prompt": "$\\int (-{a}\\operatorname{csc}y\\,\\operatorname{cot}y)\\,\\text{d}y=$",
    "source_id": "q-71657",
    "variable": "y",
    "fields": [],
    "difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
    "solution": "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\operatorname{csc}y\\operatorname{cot}y\\,\\text{d}y & =-\\operatorname{csc}y+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (-{a}\\operatorname{csc}y\\,\\operatorname{cot}y)\\,\\text{d}y & =-{a}\\int \\operatorname{csc}y\\operatorname{cot}y\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =-{a}(-\\operatorname{csc}y)+C \\\\  & ={a}\\operatorname{csc}y+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$"
  },
